     NOT A NEW RUNG (D42): the highest power of Carter here is Q^2, which first appeared at rank 4; everything above the floor is Q^q times odd-degree reducibles (q = 1..2). Rank 4's outcome made this the strongly favoured one. Not a corollary -- the extra momentum factor changes the O(zeta) source, as at rank 3 -- but not an independent test either.
